Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:03.48,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:07.48,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Rio is my cousin and a \Nprince of this kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:09.71,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,Yes, that's how things turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:13.34,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,It isn't officially acknowledged, \Nbut Rio is of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:17.99,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Could it be that the two \Nof you are teasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:24.13,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,There's no way an average village \Nperson could marry a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:27.59,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,Rio's father gained \Nrecognition during the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:29.75,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,and was raised to the rank of warrior-noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.75,0:00:33.72,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,All of us elderly folk \Nin the village know the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.97,0:00:39.02,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,A warrior-noble... In that case, it wouldn't\N be so strange to meet a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:40.22,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:42.64,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,That's what I've been saying, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.41,0:00:47.19,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh... L-L-Lord Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.19,0:00:49.55,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,I-I apologize for my rudeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.80,0:00:54.01,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Please, wait. Let's not do that, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:55.53,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:59.34,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,L-Lord Rio, you're royalty, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.34,0:01:04.00,main,Rio,0,0,0,,My mother may have been, \Nbut I'm not. So, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.76,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Treat me the way you have been up to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.73,0:01:11.12,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Rio... Can I call you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.45,0:01:12.59,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.59,0:01:14.50,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Please, do everything the \Nway you have been doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:17.48,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,I will do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:19.51,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Your speech hasn't changed back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:21.32,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Oh! Yes, uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:24.28,main,Rio,0,0,0,,This is all so sudden.\N It must be troubling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.52,main,Rio,0,0,0,,but Miss Ruri, I hope to \Ncontinue our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:29.25,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.64,0:01:31.11,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Oh. That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.11,0:01:34.27,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Since we're cousins, calling \Nme "Miss" Ruri is a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:37.74,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,I want you to refer to me \Nin a more familiar way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:38.71,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:42.08,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Well, um... Yes, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.08,0:01:45.37,main,Rio,0,0,0,,No, sorry. You're right, Ruri.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:47.29,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Will this work all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:49.04,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:54.33,main,Rio,0,0,0,,And, this might be a little premature, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:59.79,main,Rio,0,0,0,,There is something I would \Nlike to tell both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.79,0:02:01.89,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,You're being so formal. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:07.39,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of leaving this \Nvillage by this time next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.39,0:02:12.05,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,I see. You will be missed, \Nbut it can't be helped, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.61,0:02:15.32,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,Will you return to the land \Nwhere you grew up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:18.89,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes. There's somewhere I'd like \Nto stop by along the way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.26,0:02:22.78,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,You'll come back to this village \Nagain someday, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:27.42,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Well... If it's permitted, \NI'd like to come back one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.42,0:02:29.92,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Of course it's allowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:31.40,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.40,0:02:34.04,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,That's right. Come back any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:36.13,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,You're a member of this village, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:38.21,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:39.63,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:41.64,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Since you said there was somewhere \Nyou wanted to stop by,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.04,0:02:45.60,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,does that mean there's someone \Nwaiting for you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:47.80,main,Rio,0,0,0,,We aren't related by blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:50.70,main,Rio,0,0,0,,but there's someone who thinks \Nof me as an older brother...
