Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.23,0:04:25.45,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:28.99,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Huh? Rio, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.24,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Oh, Ruri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:34.32,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I haven't said hello to \Neveryone since coming back,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:36.88,main,Rio,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd go around \Nand see everyone properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.66,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:40.71,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:41.87,main,girl,0,0,0,,That manner of speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.25,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, your tone of voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:47.04,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Why are you speaking with \NMiss Ruri that way like it's normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:47.86,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:49.61,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Oh, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:51.46,main,girl,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this, Ruri?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.56,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.26,0:04:56.60,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,I mean, we're living in the same house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:05:01.95,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,I just asked him to stop using all \Nthat formal language, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:06.87,main,Rio,0,0,0,,She asked—Miss Ruri \Nasked me a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:09.18,main,Rio,0,0,0,,so I've tried to change \Nthe way I speak, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.61,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Does it sound strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:11.69,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.69,0:05:13.12,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,It isn't strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:14.99,main,girls,0,0,0,,I want that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:14.99,main,girls,0,0,0,,Sir Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:15.98,main,girls,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:44.15,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:48.61,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,I planted the seedlings in my area\N just the way you told me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:50.16,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:53.73,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Then, will you go and help the \Nothers who haven't finished yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:55.89,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.41,main,Dora,0,0,0,,Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:06:00.18,main,Dora,0,0,0,,Ruri's so hardworking! \NShe'll make a good bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:00.88,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:02.85,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I think so, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:05.04,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:06.72,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Don't tease me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.67,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Miss Sayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:13.22,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Shall I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:16.34,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh! Sir Rio, I-I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.34,0:06:17.77,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I wasn't paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:19.98,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Please make sure you remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:25.01,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'd like you to supervise everyone \Nin the village in what I've taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:27.39,main,Rio,0,0,0,,After I've gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:29.32,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:32.28,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Though it all depends on \Nwhether it turns out well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:33.99,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Sir Rio...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:36.31,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Are you leaving the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.35,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:39.87,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I haven't told anyone else yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:43.41,main,Rio,0,0,0,,but this fall, around the time \Nthe harvest festival ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:44.89,main,Rio,0,0,0,,that's when I'm thinking of going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:50.27,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,This fall... I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:52.26,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:56.04,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,if you're staying close, you could come back \Nto the village regularly, couldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:59.00,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm planning to travel across the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:01.65,main,Rio,0,0,0,,so I don't know if I'll be \Nable to come back regularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:03.23,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Oh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:06.61,main,Rio,0,0,0,,It's still early,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.61,0:07:09.46,main,Rio,0,0,0,,but I wanted to tell you well \Nahead of time, Miss Sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:11.92,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Miss Sayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.12,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:17.64,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Oh! No. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.78,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I got something in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:23.21,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Oh, I see! It's because \NI have dirt on my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:27.61,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'll use spirit arts to make some water.\N Please, use it to wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:30.88,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Sayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.36,0:07:33.76,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:37.64,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I got some dirt in my eye. \NSir Rio was helping me wash it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:39.22,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Oh, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:40.37,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:44.63,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I'm behind on my section, \Nso I'll go back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:48.16,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.85,0:08:09.00,main,Shin,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:12.76,main,Shin,0,0,0,,H-Hey... Sayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:17.79,main,Shin,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:20.82,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Sorry, Big Brother. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:23.33,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I'll make dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:25.77,main,Shin,0,0,0,,This is no time to be cooking, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:28.48,main,Shin,0,0,0,,Who was it? Who made you cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:30.24,main,Shin,0,0,0,,Was it Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:33.53,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,N-No, it's not like... \NSir Rio didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:35.10,main,Shin,0,0,0,,That dirtbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.63,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,No! It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:42.00,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Sir Rio said he'll be leaving the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.01,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:45.75,main,Shin,0,0,0,,He's leaving the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.99,0:08:50.71,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,It's not like that. It has \Nnothing to do with Sir Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:54.17,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:56.64,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,B-Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:57.89,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:02.81,main,Shin,0,0,0,,Hey, Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:04.13,main,Shin,0,0,0,,Rio, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:08.27,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,What do you want with Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:09.18,main,SHin,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:10.77,main,Shin,0,0,0,,Oh, Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:12.40,main,Shin,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:15.15,main,Shin,0,0,0,,Please, stay in the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.15,0:09:15.89,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.30,0:09:19.16,main,Shin,0,0,0,,I-I know that what I'm saying is selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:23.62,main,Shin,0,0,0,,But, please, don't say anything \Nand just stay in the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:25.71,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,B-Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:28.48,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:31.50,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for the trouble \Nmy brother has caused you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:35.85,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Come on, Big Brother! \NYou're bothering them! Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:38.01,main,Shin,0,0,0,,Sayo... But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.02,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I'm really so very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:49.12,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,My brother and I will talk \Neverything through properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:53.00,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,All right. I won't ask you \Nwhat happened for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:54.74,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,Are you all right with that, Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:56.72,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes, that is fine, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:59.00,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:01.62,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Come on. We're going, Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:08.04,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Man, that bathwater was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:10.28,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:12.33,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:24.79,main,Gouki,0,0,0,,Title and rank hold no meaning here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:28.67,main,Gouki,0,0,0,,If you have confidence in your skills,\N come and challenge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:31.54,main,man A,0,0,0,,Go for it, Big Boss Gouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:33.74,main,man B,0,0,0,,Dola, you're up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:36.13,main,Dola,0,0,0,,Don't ask the impossible! \NThere's no way I can beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:37.17,main,man B,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.29,0:11:41.79,main,Kayoko,0,0,0,,To leave Sir Rio to one side and \Nsimply amuse himself at this feast...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:43.43,main,Kayoko,0,0,0,,He'll be getting a severe scolding later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:46.79,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I would rather he enjoy himself \Nwithout regard to status here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:49.47,main,Kayoko,0,0,0,,Really? We'll do that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.47,0:11:52.49,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,All right! We're making kamutan this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:56.31,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Anyone who wants some, line up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:03.50,main,Komomo,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:06.78,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,I think we should go ahead and eat.\N What about you, Komomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:10.04,main,Komomo,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm looking forward to \Nthe kamutan Sir Rio made!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:12.81,main,Gouki,0,0,0,,Ah, that was quite enjoyable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:13.84,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Mistress Kayoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:17.67,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for your help today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.05,0:12:23.58,main,Kayoko,0,0,0,,It's nothing. Lady Yuba kindly invited \Nus to this harvest festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:25.05,main,Kayoko,0,0,0,,It was the least I could do in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:26.88,main,Rio,0,0,0,,We're honored and grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:28.55,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.55,0:12:31.06,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, may I have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:33.14,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:35.25,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Um, I wanted to discuss something...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:38.11,main,Komomo,0,0,0,,Father, you were amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:39.62,main,Gouki,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.62,0:12:40.98,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,I'll make it again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.99,0:12:46.49,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That hairpin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.76,main,Rio,0,0,0,,You're still using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:50.99,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Oh... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:53.28,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:55.00,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:58.89,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I know it may be burdensome \Nto hear this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:01.51,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:04.51,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I am in love with you, Sir Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.51,0:13:12.87,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Miss Sayo, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.17,0:13:16.86,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I can't return your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:23.03,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I-Is that because... Is it because \Nyou're leaving the village, Sir Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:26.59,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That isn't the whole reason, but... yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:29.58,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Then, please, take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:32.26,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Th-That's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.26,0:13:35.83,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I've worked hard so that \NI wouldn't slow you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:41.30,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I've trained my body and practiced my\N spirit arts every day for the last six months!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:43.26,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:45.83,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Please! I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:48.55,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can \Nnot to hold you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:51.78,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That isn't the issue at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.33,0:13:53.56,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:57.56,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I cannot return your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:13:59.78,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:03.63,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Even if you never look at me... \NEven if you never do anything for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.63,0:14:04.48,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.81,0:14:05.98,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Just let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:08.82,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,At the very least...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:11.86,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:13.84,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.84,0:14:14.99,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Miss Sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:16.58,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:19.08,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I truly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.51,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Sir Rio...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:29.16,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:36.39,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:41.39,italics,Shin,0,0,0,,That creep. He noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.39,0:14:43.51,italics,Shin,0,0,0,,He really is a despicable one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:44.59,italics,Shin,0,0,0,,Blast it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:57.12,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything\N you've done for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:58.93,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Take care, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:03.50,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,You don't need to set out \Nwhen it's still so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:07.17,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I finished my goodbyes with \Neveryone in the village yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:09.97,main,Rio,0,0,0,,And it's going to be a long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.30,0:15:12.61,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,You can come back home anytime, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.97,0:15:13.78,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:17.20,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,So, in the end, she didn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:21.27,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'll be off, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:24.43,main,Yuba,0,0,0,,Yes. Be sure to take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:28.19,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I will. Ruri, Mistress Yuba, \NI hope you both stay well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.85,0:15:31.15,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.15,0:15:33.07,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:35.39,main,Ruri,0,0,0,,Have a good trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:43.83,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Miss Sayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.35,0:15:47.59,flashback,Gouki,0,0,0,,Young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.98,0:15:51.08,flashback,Gouki,0,0,0,,Are you in love with Sir Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.69,0:15:54.05,flashback,Sayo,0,0,0,,What? Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:58.10,flashback,Gouki,0,0,0,,Do you love him enough to cast aside \Nthis village where you were born and raised?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:01.12,flashback,Sayo,0,0,0,,W-Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:02.37,flashback,Gouki,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:05.92,flashback,Gouki,0,0,0,,I thought perhaps, but...\NI seem to have misread things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:07.74,flashback,Sayo,0,0,0,,W-Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:08.86,flashback,Sayo,0,0,0,,I love him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.86,0:16:11.03,flashback,Sayo,0,0,0,,I love Sir Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:14.53,flashback,Gouki,0,0,0,,And there is no falsehood in your words?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:15.78,flashback,Sayo,0,0,0,,There is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:17.88,flashback,Gouki,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:24.17,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,S-Sir Rio, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:28.17,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Please, take good care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:31.77,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:33.49,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I hope you'll take even better \Ncare of yourself, Miss Sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:35.53,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I will. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:37.06,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Sir Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.06,0:16:38.10,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:42.06,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I'm going to work really hard! \NI'll do my very best, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:44.27,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,You have to do your best too, Sir Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:46.42,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I will. I'll work very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:50.65,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,G-Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:55.34,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I am truly happy you came \Nto see me off, Miss Sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.27,0:16:57.88,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:17:01.71,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,I'm glad I gathered my \Ncourage and came here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:03.45,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:05.25,main,Sayo,0,0,0,,Yes. Until we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:07.90,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That's true. Until we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:32.11,sign_5011_20_The_Kingdom_of_B,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,300)}Year 999 of the Holy Era, Late Autumn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.25,0:17:35.47,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:37.49,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Orphia's Ariel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:39.81,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:49.04,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:53.67,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:01.18,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I was able to have a lot of good experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:03.18,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Well, that's the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:06.77,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, you have a \Ngrandmother and a cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:11.77,main,Rio,0,0,0,,When I told them I have a little sister, \Nthey both said they wanted to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:14.19,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,I think I might want to meet them, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:16.69,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Well then, Sir Rio...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:20.16,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,How long do you think you will be able \Nto stay in the village this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:22.88,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Probably a few months at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:25.20,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,You're leaving again, Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:26.70,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Latifa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:30.19,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'll make sure I come back \Nmore quickly this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:32.17,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,That's a promise, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:34.17,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes. That's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:35.86,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.86,0:18:39.18,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Was there anything you found yourself \Nrunning short of on your journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:41.13,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:43.70,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I still have plenty in \Nthe way of supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:47.64,main,Rio,0,0,0,,but as I was traveling, \Na thought did occur to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:49.94,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I was hoping that you might lend your wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:54.29,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Of course. Tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:56.63,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Actually, I was thinking about building
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:18:59.53,main,Rio,0,0,0,,a house I could take with \Nme in the space-time cache.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:02.78,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,Oh, a house, huh? \NThat's an interesting thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.78,0:19:05.72,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Carrying a house... That would mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:10.44,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Would he want a house that could be \Nset in place without a foundation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:11.53,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:13.09,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,But that said...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:19.02,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,He'd probably have to use spirit arts \Nto prepare the ground every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:21.84,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Once he's like this, \Nhe won't return for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:23.34,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.69,0:19:27.14,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, leave the house to Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:32.00,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,In the meantime, you should spend all the \Ntime you can with Latifa and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:33.92,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Right, Latifa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:34.77,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:38.36,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,I want to be with Onii-chan the \Nwhole time he's in the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.03,0:19:41.76,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I've returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.11,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:46.95,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Were you able to have a nice \Nlong talk with the Eldest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:51.39,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes. I was relieved to see that \Neveryone seems as sprightly as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.39,0:19:55.86,main,Sara,0,0,0,,They all must have been surprised to see \Nhow grown up you've gotten, Master Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:59.28,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I suppose they were. It has \Nbeen two years, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:02.80,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,Master Rio, you've grown so much
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:06.77,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,that Miss Sara and Alma seem to \Nhave gotten quite shy around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:09.30,main,Sara,0,0,0,,I-I'm not shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:12.10,main,Alma,0,0,0,,The only shy one here is Big Sister Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:15.14,main,Sara,0,0,0,,A-Alma! Stop saying such weird things!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:19.21,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing, Master Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:20.65,main,Rio,0,0,0,,No, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:23.26,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I just feel like I've really come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:27.78,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Both of you have become more like \Ngrown ladies. You're lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.78,0:20:30.47,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.47,0:20:33.25,main,Alma,0,0,0,,I haven't changed much at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.53,0:20:35.72,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.72,0:20:37.68,main,Rio,0,0,0,,You've grown a little taller, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:40.75,main,Alma,0,0,0,,Yes, well... just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.75,0:20:46.00,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,It must be so nice, Miss Sara, Alma, \Nto have Master Rio praise you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:49.06,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Miss Orphia, you've become \Nmore beautiful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.57,0:20:52.23,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That calm aura of yours has only grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.86,0:20:55.31,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:57.18,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Say, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:58.95,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Want to take a bath together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.95,0:21:00.01,main,girls,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:03.96,main,Sara,0,0,0,,O-Of course he doesn't! What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:05.03,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.25,0:22:45.58,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.07,0:22:52.77,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,So, I'm dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.77,0:22:57.02,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm still asleep. That's for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.26,0:23:03.44,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,Why am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.95,0:23:06.16,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,sleeping with a naked girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.72,0:23:19.12,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Wh-What's the matter, Master Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:24.53,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.53,0:23:25.66,main,Alma,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.66,0:23:27.13,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:30.38,main,Rio,0,0,0,,W-Wait! It's not like that! \NIt's a misunderstanding! This is—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:31.88,main,girls,0,0,0,,What?!
